      "body": "Same NVSHMEM failure on `main`: [daily 96139](https://buildkite.com/vllm/ci/builds/96139#01a15932-cfd7-4061-9d4d-38e6e8102118) Shards 1/3 and 3/3 ([Shard 3/3](https://buildkite.com/vllm/ci/builds/96139#01a15932-cfd7-443b-88fa-829a5e63faba)), Oct 20, and [nightly 95338](https://buildkite.com/vllm/ci/builds/95338#01a1434e-bbcc-448b-a4be-39d1e29cfb97) EPLB, Oct 16. In build 96292 the three jobs passed on retry: [EPLB](https://buildkite.com/vllm/ci/builds/96292#01a15e9f-ce18-4040-936e-8f6e371b768a), [Shard 2/3](https://buildkite.com/vllm/ci/builds/96292#01a15e9f-d859-4baa-8c1f-ec0328b03933), [Shard 3/3](https://buildkite.com/vllm/ci/builds/96292#01a15e9f-e2d8-4992-b51d-e298d850560a). Failure rates are in the description.\n\n<sub>Reviewed with the help of Claude Code.</sub>\n",
